<title>HUNGARY: Borsodchem, MOL unit to set up JV.</title>
<headline>Borsodchem, MOL unit to set up JV.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian chemical company Borsodchem said on Wednesday it agreed with MolChem Kft, a unit of oil and gas company MOL, to set up a joint trading company in Milan.</p>
<p>The new company, to be called BC-MC Kft, will start to operate on April 1, 1997, following court and chamber registrations in Italy, Borsodchem said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
